# Form Standards

All forms must handle:
- initial state
- validation state
- loading state
- success state when relevant
- error state

## Validation

- Validate user input appropriately.
- Show user-friendly validation messages.
- Prevent duplicate submissions.

## UX

- Disable submit buttons during submission.
- Preserve user-entered values on validation failure.
- Focus important invalid fields when appropriate.

## Security

- Never expose sensitive information unnecessarily.
- Do not log passwords or tokens.